+  mechanism — a block declares `type:name` and each type resolves to something real on disk — not
+  as two hardcoded special cases. Recorded as contract amendment "2026-08-03 (2)".
+  Stated to him before the ruling, and repeated here so it is not mistaken for scope: this adds
+  the VOCABULARY only. A news feed still needs ingestion, storage and a page, none of which is in
+  this PR. Predictions need no new type at all — we build our own rather than take the provider's
