 }
 
+/* ---- landing: fixtures hero (#367) ----
+ * A COMPACT stacked fixture row, which none of the existing patterns provides:
+ * `.nextfx` is a single "next fixture" card (3 columns, teams on one line), `.mast`/`.teams` is the
+ * fixture page's CENTRED hero at 27px names, and `.rmatch` is a played-result row keyed to a W/D/L
+ * chip. A list of twelve upcoming matches needs its own row, so this is a new component (flagged in
+ * the 00_overview census), not a per-page restyle of an existing one.
+ *
+ * Stacking the two teams is what frees the right-hand column for the kickoff, and it is the layout
+ * every comparable fixture list uses. Names are sentence case at 15px: the first version of this
+ * block wrapped each group in `.mgroup`, whose uppercase/letter-spaced/centred/muted rules INHERIT,
+ * so every team name rendered as heading chrome. */
+.fxgroup { margin-top: 26px; }
+.fxgroup:first-of-type { margin-top: 10px; }
+.fxgroup > .gh {
+  display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
+  padding-bottom: 7px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--div);
+}
+.fxgroup > .gh .nm { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
+.fxrow {
+  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
+  padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
+}
+.fxrow:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
+.fxrow .sides { display: grid; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
+.fxrow .side { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; }
+.fxrow .side .nm {
+  font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); min-width: 0;
+  overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
+}
+.fxrow .when { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
+.fxrow .when .t { display: block; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
+.fxrow .when .d { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
+/* Small crest for list rows. The base .crest is a 52px block built for the fixture masthead. */
+.crest.xs { width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 9px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
+
